    <!-- Why this matters -->
    <section class="section oa-why">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <span class="section-label">Why this matters for you</span>
        <h2 class="headline-md">The features that feel easy.</h2>
        <p>
          You will never see the model name. You will never tune a
          temperature. You will never read a token bill. What you'll
          notice is that the admin answers your question, the search
          finds what you meant, the product description writes itself,
          and the help knows your platform.
